Here's the trick from wikihack:

| With two rings of slow digestion, and good technique, the player can
| go indefinitely long without losing any nutrition, because the ring
| hunger for each hand is calculated on different turns. The process is
| to wear both rings, but removing one of the rings for the turn that
| its hunger is calculated. Your left hand hunger is calculated turn 4
| (mod 20); right hand hunger is calculated on turn 12 (mod 20).

http://nethack.wikia.com/wiki/Ring_of_slow_digestion

